# TEMP(transformers) Antarctica route: RESEARCH CENTER warp gate -> look over the research camp.
# Scripted route checkpoint.
# 6 = arrival view (spawn_research), 7 = "turn right about 45 degrees and look over the camp" (view_start..view_end).
# Requires your own matching saved-game state; distributed seeds are omitted.
# With this card the gate menu opens on RESEARCH CENTER (order with 'left': RC -> Icebreaker -> Crevasse Field ->
# Ice Canyon -> RC), so no left/right press is needed. Stick: lx ly rx ry, 128 = centre; rx=255 = camera turn right.
# Scripted route checkpoint.
# Route checkpoint.
# Measurement window: view_start..view_end (900 pads, camera and character still).
budget 1200s
stall 900 hard 3600
watchdog warn 30 600
defaults hold=3 gap=6 timeout=3000vs
dumpsteps on
boot: wait seen /FMV/NATTRACT.PSS timeout 4000vs
      wait pads 4
title: press start until pads 200 every 40 max 5
       mark main_menu
menu: press down
      wait pads 20
      press cross
      wait pads 60 timeout 9000vs
      mark saved_games
loadsave: press cross until cd /SOUND/MUSIC/UI_MAIN.MS every 120 max 2 timeout 3000vs
hub: wait pads 40 timeout 9000vs
     mark hub_loaded
     press cross
     wait pads 100 timeout 9000vs
     mark globe
gate: press cross
      wait pads 100 timeout 9000vs
      mark gate_research_center
enter: press cross until cd /SOUND/MUSIC/ANTA.MS every 30 max 3 timeout 6000vs
       mark ant_load
spawn: wait pads 400 timeout 20000vs
       mark spawn_research
turn: stick 128 128 255 128
      wait pads 13 timeout 20000vs
      stick none
      mark turn_released
settle: wait pads 60 timeout 20000vs
        mark view_start
view: wait pads 900 timeout 40000vs
      mark view_end
      pass Antarctica Research Center camp view route complete
